  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Users trying to use the VCC SDK World/Base version 3.1.11 are unable to Build & Publish or Build & Test when they have never had any previous SDK versions installed.\n\nHaving people with this issue downgrade or install older SDK versions into any Unity project resolves the issue. Some setup processes may be missing or broken in the current SDK version, resulting in primarily new users or users with fresh Unity installs being unable to publish or test content.\n\nThere is no console error output that indicates that anything is wrong when encountering this issue, the “Build & Test” and “Build & Publish for X” buttons can be pressed but appear to do nothing.",
